    "description": "Immutable audit trail for every action across your AppPress platform \u2014 tracks who did what, when, across all core and plugin events. Provides a filterable, exportable admin log, channel-specific workflow triggers, REST ingestion for external systems, and a before_record filter for FERPA/privacy suppression. Implements StandardContracts::AUDIT_LOG so any plugin or App Pack can write to the log without a direct dependency.",
